  "createdAt": "2026-10-11T21:28:41.936312Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T07:16:51.843187Z",
  "totalBlocks": 78,
  "translatedBlocks": 71,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10db12d7868d08d7",
      "translationZh": "源自 Kimina Prover 的精简训练流水线，保留核心功能，并与 verl 完全兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44da561f02ae147d",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴推出 kimina-prover-rl，这是一个用于 Lean 4 形式化定理证明的开源训练流水线，基于受 DeepSeek-R1 启发的结构化先推理、后生成范式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92ed93ad5a7183af",
      "translationZh": "该训练流水线是我们用于训练 Kimina Prover 的系统的简化版本，保留了系统的关键组件，并与开源 Verl 框架完全兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50d166bcb9653d67",
      "translationZh": "它作为 Verl 的一个分叉版本的一部分发布，完整的训练方案位于 recipe/kimina-prover-rl 中，任何人都可以复现我们的实验，或调整配置以适配自己的模型和数据集。配置和启动该流水线所需的全部信息都可以在该训练方案的 README 中找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d302cca4fdfd4142",
      "translationZh": "作为这一训练流水线的成果，我们发布了两个模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f45cc4b890f738d0",
      "translationZh": "AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-RL-1.7B，一个拥有 1.7B 参数的模型，在 MiniF2F 基准测试上取得了 76.63% 的 Pass@32 成绩——为这一规模类别的开源模型树立了新的最佳水平",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0bedb20a56840da4",
      "translationZh": "AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-RL-0.6B，一个拥有 0.6B 参数的模型，在 MiniF2F 基准测试上取得了 71.30% 的 Pass@32 成绩——同样为这一规模类别的开源模型树立了新的最佳水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b125c88883a8c3e",
      "translationZh": "kimina-prover-rl 是一个训练流水线，旨在教会大语言模型求解 Lean 4 中的形式化证明目标，采用两阶段输出结构：先给出自然语言推理轨迹，再给出相应的 Lean 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1620f1c9ecfe322d",
      "translationZh": "这一范式受到 DeepSeek-R1 的启发，使模型能够将规划与执行分离，从而提升可解释性、错误恢复能力和泛化能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c760887d1b1fa8",
      "translationZh": "为了在这一推理框架下训练模型，我们采用 GRPO——一种专为大语言模型设计的强化学习方法。Kimina-prover 训练流水线的这一开源版本使用强化学习库 Verl 实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f61051bea23040e4",
      "translationZh": "在 GRPO 的 rollout 阶段，模型为每个提示生成 N 个输出。对于任何一个输出，如果其中的 Lean 代码通过我们的 kimina-lean-server 成功获得 Lean 验证，就会被赋予 1 的奖励。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7d470fe7f572131",
      "translationZh": "该框架新增了两个主要特性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72367fde1a7a42f2",
      "translationZh": "格式检查奖励，用于教会模型按规定结构组织输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81f49f50ffcdf2ed",
      "translationZh": "纠错轮次，用于鼓励模型从失败信号中学习",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "501abcc97fbfa1d7",
      "translationZh": "训练期间，必须同时验证大量 Lean 4 候选证明。为了高效处理这些验证任务，我们需要一个高吞吐量的验证系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b471707a2bc06e5",
      "translationZh": "为满足这一需求，Numina 和 Kimi 开发了一个名为 kimina-lean-server 的开源服务器，支持使用 Lean 4 进行大规模并行证明检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "509c86b1cd15025f",
      "translationZh": "为简化集成，我们还提供了 kimina-client，这是一个轻量级 Python 包（可在 PyPI 上获取），提供了简洁的接口，用于与服务器的 API 交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4411e525721e7dd8",
      "translationZh": "数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a41579a369d4c29f",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Kimina-Prover-Promptset 进行训练，它是 NuminaMath-LEAN 数据集中经过精心筛选的一个子集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf33968525201719",
      "translationZh": "针对这一训练设置，我们按以下方式对数据集进行筛选和预处理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bcd2a4e1d1b25d4",
      "translationZh": "移除历史成功率高于 0.5 的简单题目，使数据集仅保留具有挑战性的命题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "326c8e1ce8333291",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gemini 生成现有题目的变体，以增加多样性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "786783815839deca",
      "translationZh": "复制难题，使它们在训练中获得更高的权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "006da7ee86b1306c",
      "translationZh": "最终得到的数据集包含具有挑战性的高价值问题，可用于改进 Lean 4 定理证明模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "525c4438f6952a0d",
      "translationZh": "NuminaMath-LEAN-RL 也是用于训练 AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-RL-1.7B 和 AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-RL-0.6B 的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6cb01358376869f",
      "translationZh": "输入格式示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96a36ce2c31f4c3b",
      "translationZh": "格式奖励",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77b47297523b6683",
      "translationZh": "我们推理训练流程的核心思想是将 LLM 的输出组织为两个阶段：一个思考块，后接一个 lean4 块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47da6dbc204a5051",
      "translationZh": "一个推理块（ ... ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1c09941393bf642",
      "translationZh": "一个 Lean 4 代码块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f71b215f14e9d4f4",
      "translationZh": "每次 rollout 都会经过验证，以确保遵守这一格式。如果输出格式不正确——例如，缺少 <think> 块或代码位置有误——模型就会获得零奖励，无论证明实际上是否有效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c69da9c956ccc2",
      "translationZh": "这会强制保持一致性，并教会模型可靠地组织输出结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "603d6caf6c7c7e2f",
      "translationZh": "在 kimina-prover 中，这些检查不只是验证是否存在 <think> 和 lean4 块，还包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8d81c7ac1e2d3cd",
      "translationZh": "确保每个输出恰好包含一个 <think>...</think> 块和一个 lean4 代码块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90cb04fe6e6a0b89",
      "translationZh": "拒绝包含重复推理行的输出，因为这通常表明生成内容存在幻觉或退化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a06a13aea9a4286e",
      "translationZh": "检查思考部分中的策略块是否数量充足，以及是否包含足够多的非注释行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "099162c2fbfc591a",
      "translationZh": "对注释密度（在推理和 Lean 代码中）设置阈值，以惩罚过于冗长或充斥模板化内容的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da263dfc731861c3",
      "translationZh": "使用匹配分数（例如交并比或子代码覆盖率），比较块中描述的策略与最终 Lean 代码之间的语义一致性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4c18ed2be8efb4d",
      "translationZh": "对不必要的冗长回答施加惩罚，鼓励模型在仍然给出完整回复的同时，更高效地使用词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b1b65dcbe8595f9",
      "translationZh": "只有通过所有这些检查的生成结果，才被视为格式规范，并且可以获得奖励。这种结构化筛选提高了训练稳定性，并鼓励清晰的推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7bdad567af23bae",
      "translationZh": "错误纠正",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bf56a97c8d192e5",
      "translationZh": "为了让训练提供更多有用信息，我们加入了一种错误纠正机制，让模型有机会修正自己失败的证明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08d3bcefed9753a3",
      "translationZh": "当一次 rollout 失败时（例如，由于 Lean 错误或证明不正确），我们会：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5a18e748248a2f1",
      "translationZh": "保存完整的提示、回复和 Lean 反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5fe4a5214c3f37d",
      "translationZh": "创建一个新的训练样本，在其中明确提示模型修改它先前的推理/代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d6dae7ba322f020",
      "translationZh": "由于训练期间会提供 lean 反馈，这会鼓励模型从失败信号中学习。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e125635f29b0c4e",
      "translationZh": "它还支持多轮交互链，将 Lean 的反馈作为提示的一部分注入其中，并在模型成功调试自身输出时给予奖励。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a764d87d670a6055",
      "translationZh": "由于多轮响应可能变得很长，我们只允许一轮错误修正，并将错误消息限制在设定的 token 数量以内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "428b9ef1383795d1",
      "translationZh": "流程概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66283bbf3aeb5a0a",
      "translationZh": "《理解类 R1-Zero 训练：批判性视角》（Understanding R1-Zero-Like Training: A Critical Perspective）这项工作指出，GRPO 中存在优化偏差，会导致响应人为变长，尤其是错误的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9c4948fe0788d95",
      "translationZh": "我们在实验过程中也注意到了这一行为，并使用 DrGPO 进行优化。DrGRPO 通过用一个全局常数进行归一化来聚合 token 级损失，从而消除长度偏差。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "481191d9c0ac03e0",
      "translationZh": "仓库中提供的配置文件适用于 8 个 GPU 的配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "762c3ee204458b0e",
      "translationZh": "我们正在微调的模型是 AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-Distill-1.7B。该模型是 Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B 的微调版本，使用的冷启动数据由我们的 AI-MO/Kimina-Prover-72B 模型生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2386b7cf8d8d48d0",
      "translationZh": "每一步都会从训练数据集中取出 256 个样本。其中一半是错误修正样本。我们为每个样本生成 8 次 rollout，因此共生成 2048 个结果。如果使用多个节点，可以将 rollout 次数增加到 16 或 32。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e21613c9c073fcc",
      "translationZh": "我们每隔 5 个训练步骤评估一次模型，使用 verl 的 best@8 指标来快速完成验证。如果你使用多个节点，可以增加到 best@16 或 32。我们会评估纠错轮次前后的性能。对于每个失败的回答，我们允许模型再尝试一次，以修正其证明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc216f7781c59f1",
      "translationZh": "经过几个训练步骤后，我们观察到性能持续提升。在本节中，我们将讨论在 8 块 H100 GPU 上训练 48 小时后的训练指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21769203f7c11a78",
      "translationZh": "到第 85 步时，该流水线使模型的准确率提高了 4 个百分点，best@8 指标达到 70%，纠错轮次后达到 74%：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9b0b7ca691b9b38",
      "translationZh": "与此同时，我们观察到格式错误的数量在训练过程中稳步减少，这表明模型正在学习生成结构上有效的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c0a3d7c3df94d8",
      "translationZh": "最后，正如在 DeepSeek-R1 风格的训练设置下所预期的那样，模型输出的平均 token 长度随着训练而增加——这表明模型正在学习以更长、结构更清晰的轨迹进行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3ac88d1f01a88ad",
      "translationZh": "训练结束后，我们使用 pass@32 分别在有纠错和无纠错的情况下评估了模型。我们成功使 1.7B 模型在 MiniF2F 上的 pass@32 性能提升了超过 3%：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e1adb4386014e4f",
      "translationZh": "带错误修正的 Pass@32",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b2c5a2dee235ae0",
      "translationZh": "使用这套训练流程，我们还微调了一个 0.6B 模型，使其性能提升了超过 2%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78fcf341c11c831a",
      "translationZh": "通过 Kimina-Prover-RL，我们提供了一套轻量而强大的强化学习流水线，用于训练 Lean 4 定理证明器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66d510fbff2b2455",
      "translationZh": "通过结合结构化推理、格式奖励和错误纠正，我们在参数规模为 0.6B–1.7B 的开源模型中取得了最先进的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cb59a53c2521be3",
      "translationZh": "除模型外，我们还发布了 Verl 的一个分支版本，其中在 recipe/kimina-prover-rl 中包含了完整的训练方案，以便社区复现我们的结果，或调整这套流水线，使其适用于自己的数据集和模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e34bb0f052b3c2a0",
      "translationZh": "我们希望此次发布能为社区在形式化推理中开展 RL 训练实验提供坚实基础，并推动 Lean 4 中开源自动定理证明的能力极限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
